@startuml
!include ../../_style.puml
title UC05 — Preview a configured migration
actor Administrator
participant "Migration form" as UI
participant migration_planner as Planner
participant plan_selection as Selection
participant "placement / copy_decision / author_policy" as Rules
database "Plan / operations" as DB
Administrator -> UI : Profile / capture values / layout review
UI -> Planner : preview(...)
Planner -> Rules : Unique pair / target placement / file decision
Rules --> Planner : Copy / skip / blocker and snapshots
Planner -> DB : Store immutable intent and digest
Planner --> UI : Reviewed report
Administrator -> UI : Include / exclude selected operations
UI -> Selection : save(planid, digest, visible, included)
Selection -> DB : Update inclusions / approval digest / log
note over UI, DB : Inclusions update approval before the first run.
@enduml
